{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the demo of <strong>BLACK SECTOR</strong>, a first glimpse into the haunting world set beneath Lower Silesia, Poland.<br>In this short playable preview, you take on the role of investigative journalist \u0141ukasz as he begins his journey into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s included in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short section of the story introducing the atmosphere and main character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 15\u201330 minutes of play (depending on exploration).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a limited portion of the underground environment with eerie corridors and chambers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience core mechanics such as movement, basic exploration, document discovery, and puzzle-solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a taste of the VHS-inspired visuals and immersive sound design that define the full game\u2019s mood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo offers a focused sample of the atmosphere and gameplay mechanics you can expect in the full version, giving you an early chance to step into the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046810/extras/f130335eba559624bdb8596f31a733ef.poster.avif?t=1758863269\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046810/extras/f130335eba559624bdb8596f31a733ef.webm?t=1758863269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steam